  "abstract_summary": "An agent's long-term memory today is a set of files plus an index of those files. The index is either loaded into the context at every session, or kept in a retrieval system outside the model. This record proposes a third place for the index. The memory contents stay in files, unchanged. Only the index is trained in...",
